          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">So what just happened?</span>\n<ol>\n<li>Agent recieves: \"When is Unix's birthday?\"</li>\n<li>Agent recognizes: This requires past\nconversation context.</li>\n<li>Agent calls: <code>load_memory(\"birthday\")</code></li>\n<li>Memory returns: Previous conversation\ncontaining \"January 1st, 1970\"</li>\n<li>Agent responds: \"Unix's birthday is\nJanuary 1st, 1970\"</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The memory worked, even though it is a\ncompletely different session!</span></span>"
          }
        }
