        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Users can search memories directly in code.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This is useful for:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Debugging memory contents</li>\n<li>Building analytics dashboards</li>\n<li>Creating custom memory management UIs</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The <code>search_memory()</code> method takes a text query\nand returns <code>SearchMemoryResponse</code> with\nmatching memories.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Let us test by searching for color preferences!</span></span>"
