    },
    {
      "id": "xtbH",
      "code_hash": "8f217c351cdea81d6f6e8a7bdae36d3b",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Lets break down <strong>what just happened-</strong></span>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>First Conversation:</strong> Mentioned a gift to \nnephew.</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Callback auto-saved it to memory</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Second conversation (new session):</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>preload_memory</code> automatically retrieved the\nmemory</li>\n<li>Agent answered correctly.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>No manual memory calls!</strong></li>\n</ol></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "huHK",
      "code_hash": "14c06f3af0fe1d875237b75f12846130",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>How often should folks save session to\nmemory (by usecase)</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Real-time memory updates</span>\n<ul>\n<li>After every turn</li>\n<li>use <code>after_agent_callback</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Batch processing (reduce API calls)</span>\n<ul>\n<li>End of conversation</li>\n<li>manual call when session ends</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Long-running conversations</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Periodic intervals</li>\n<li>Timer-based background job</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Gkor",
      "code_hash": "6318c11f44a054a460bcf354cc1ad2ed",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"memory-consolidation\">Memory Consolidation</h2></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "oHns",
      "code_hash": "7b8ca69313a96def3802134414aa8583",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"limitations-of-raw-storage\">Limitations of Raw Storage</h3></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lZMa",
      "code_hash": "1e0223237655454d9c345f716fff11fd",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>What we've stored so far:</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Every user message</li>\n<li>Every agent response</li>\n<li>Every tool call</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>the problem:</strong> </span>\n<div class=\"language-actionscript3 codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Session</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">messages</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokens</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Memory</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">All</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">messages</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stored</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Search</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Returns</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">messages</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Agent</span>\n<span class=\"n\">must</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">porcess</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tokens</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This doe not scale. We need <em>consolidation</em>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "emiZ",
      "code_hash": "926a23c727383fb785c2866e885bc311",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"what-is-memory-consolidation\">What is Memory Consolidation?</h3></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "edhd",
      "code_hash": "2419b34869928a832dae31040b60b91e",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Memory Consolidation</strong> is extracting\n<em>only important facts</em> while discarding\nconversational noise.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">For example:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Raw Storage - Before Consolidation</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><div class=\"language-text codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>User: &quot;My favorite color is BlueGreen. \nUser: I also like purple. \nUser: Actually, I prefer BlueGreen most of the \ntime.&quot;\n\nAgent: &quot;Great! I&#39;ll remember that.&quot;\nUser: &quot;Thanks!&quot;\nAgent: &quot;You&#39;re welcome!&quot;\n</code></pre></div>\nStores ALL 4 messages (redundant, verbose)</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Raw Storage - After Consolidation</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><div class=\"language-text codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>Extracted Memory: &quot;User&#39;s favorite color: \nBlueGreen&quot;\n</code></pre></div>\nStores 1 concise fact</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Benefits:</strong> less storage, faster retrieval,\nmore accurate answers.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ZXMY",
      "code_hash": "592cd1ffa19665ad7c771aaeda5fb0df",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"how-consolidation-works-conceptually\">How Consolidation Works - Conceptually</h3></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "GDrp",
      "code_hash": "8f0a1aedc1dd24c9fa27fe927b4924a2",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><ol>\n<li>Raw Session Events</li>\n<li>LLM analyzes conversation</li>\n<li>Extracts key facts</li>\n<li>Stores concise memories</li>\n<li>Merges with existing memories (deduplication!)</li>\n</ol></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "UiNC",
      "code_hash": "1b7c7ccfa369da7ed57c7443d5ced3ab",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Example transformation:</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Input: \"I am allergic to peanuts. I cannot\neat anything with nuts.\"</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Output: Memory {\n    allergy: \"peanuts, tree nuts\"<br />\n    severity: \"avoid completely\"<br />\n}  </span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
